{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006b","title":"夏侯惇从征孙权还督二十六军留居巢受乐","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯惇从征孙权还督二十六军留居巢受乐","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"从征督军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"赐乐","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":216,"label":"建安二十一年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y216","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o006","basis":"建安二十一年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006b-q","xiahoucao-q-o006","wuzhu-q-o031","zhangle-q-o010","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o006b-q","source_order":[9,18,"O006b"],"order":2113}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0027","name":"夏侯惇","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o031","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-89f18ed57ac537b291ca","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年冬〖1〗，曹公次于居巢〖2〗，遂攻濡须。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年，从征孙权。还，使惇都督二十六军〖6〗，留居巢；赐伎乐、名倡，令曰：“魏绛以和戎之功〖7〗，犹受金石之乐〖8〗，况将军乎！","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o006","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"建安十二年，录惇前后功，增封邑千八百户，并前二千五百户。二十一年，从征孙权。还，使惇都督二十六军〖6〗，留居巢；赐伎乐、名倡，令曰：“魏绛以和戎之功〖7〗，犹受金石之乐〖8〗，况将军乎！”二十四年，太祖军（击破吕布军）于摩陂，召惇常与同载；特见亲重，出入卧内〖9〗。诸将莫得比也。拜前将军，﹝二﹞督诸军还寿春，徙屯召陵。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o010","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-d060eac4284b4deb7d2f","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十一年，太祖复征孙权，到合肥；循行辽战处，叹息者良久。乃增辽兵，多留诸军，徙屯居巢。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
